    "message": "Time the 7-day run's phases past the driver and pin the driver's order\n\ninvestigate_performance patched __call__ and _record_outcome, which sent every\ntick to the Python path, so the 7-day check never ran the driver. It now times\nphases through phase_observer. Tests pin the order of each phase's steps against\nits Python method, and the driver reports kernel refusals by reason.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
